        "sid": "JDG 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bada ya chifo cha Joshuwa, Aiziraeli amuuza Mwenyezi Mlungu achiamba, “Ni kabila riphi ndirokala ra kpwandza kpwendapigana na Akanani?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu achiajibu achiamba, “Mbari ya Juda ndiyo ndiyophiya mwandzo kpwendapigana, nami tsi iyo nkaitiya mwao mikononi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi atu a mbari ya Juda achiambira ndugu zao a mbari ya Simioni, “Huphiyeni phamwenga wakati huyapigana na Akanani ili huhale tsi huriyohewa. Naswi hundaphiya phamwenga namwi wakati muyahala tsi yohewa.” Kpwa hivyo atu a Simioni achiphiya nao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi atu a Juda achendashambuliya, naye Mwenyezi Mlungu achiatiya Akanani na Aperizi mwao mikononi, hipho atu a Juda achiolaga atu elufu kumi vihani hiko mudzi wa Bezeki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumo mudzini, atu a Juda akpwendamuona mfalume Adoni-Bezeki achipigana naye na achiashinda Akanani na Aperizi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoni-Bezeki wachimbira, ela aho achimzola hadi achimgbwira na achimkata madzalagumbe ga mikononi na maguluni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoni-Bezeki achiamba, “Afalume mirongo sabaa ambao kala akaakata madzalagumbe ga mikononi na maguluni kala achitsola pukupuku zitsopokazo photsi. Vivi Mlungu akaniripha kama vyohenda.” Achimphirika Jerusalemu na achendafwa kuko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha atu a Juda achipigana na kushinda Jerusalemu. Achiolaga atu osi kpwa upanga na nyo mudzi achiutiya moho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Badaye atu a mbari ya Juda aphiya achendapigana na Akanani ariosagala tsi za myangoni, Negebu na tsi ya Shefela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1:9",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Negebu",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "ni tsi ya jangbwa iriyo uphande wa mwakani.",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Shefela",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "manaye ni",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "tsi za kugbwa.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piya ashambuliya Akanani ariosagala mudzi wa Heburoni ambao hipho mwandzo kala uchiihwa Kiriathi-ariba, achishinda makabila ga Sheshai, Ahimani na Talimai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariphola hiko, atu a Juda aphiya achendashambuliya atu a mudzi wa Debiri, ambao pho mwandzo kala uchiihwa Kiriathi-Seferi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha Kalebu achiamba, “Mutu yeyesi ndiye shambuliya mudzi wa Kiriathi-Seferi na achiushinda ndamlóza mwanangu wa chichetu Akisa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Othinieli mwana wa mdide wa Kalebu, yeihwa Kenazi, waushinda nyo mudzi, naye Kalebu achimloza mwanawe Akisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi ye Akisa ariphofika kpwa Othinieli, wamvoya ruhusa mlumewe akamvoye munda ise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1:14",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Tafusiri zanjina zinaamba",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Othinieli, wamuamba mchewe akavoye munda ise.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Phahi Akisa waphiya na ariphokala anatserera kula kpwa pundawe, Kalebu wamuuza mwanawe, “Unalonda nikuhendereni?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akisa achimjibu achimuamba, “Nakuvoya uniphe zawadi kpwa sababu wanipha munda hiko Negebu, piya nipha vidzuho vya madzi.” Phahi Kalebu achimupha vidzuho vya madzi vya uphande wa dzulu na vya uphande wa tsini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbari ya Juda iriphouka Jeriko, yani mudzi wa mitende, Akeni ariokala chivyazi cha mtsedza wa Musa aphiya phamwenga nao ko jangbwani seemu ya Juda iriyo Negebu phephi na Aradi, ahenda makalo hiko achisagala phamwenga na atu kuko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Juda na ndugu zao a mbari ya Simioni aphiya achendashinda Akanani arioishi Sefathi. Mudzi hinyo awaangamiza",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1:17",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Neno ra Chieburania ririrohumika hipha rinamaanisha kuika vyo vitu na nyo atu mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu kpwa kuvibananga-bananga au kuvilavya dza sadaka.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " tsetsetse nao achiupha dzina ranjina ra Horima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1:17",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Horima",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "manaye ni",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "kubanangbwa-banangbwa tsetsetse.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atu a mbari ya Juda piya apiga na achishinda na kuhala midzi ya Gaza na vidzidzivye, Ashikeloni na vidzidzivye na Ekironi na vidzidzivye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu wakala phamwenga na atu a mbari ya Juda nao achihala seemu za myangoni, ela taayaweza kuzola atu arioishi seemu za kugbwa mana aho kala ana magari ga vyuma ga kuvwehwa ni farasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.15.13+JOS.15.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Joshuwa 15:13–14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mudzi wa Heburoni wahewa Kalebu kulengana na malagizo ga Musa, naye achiazola anangbwa ahahu a Anaki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
