            "sid": "JDG 1:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aamori aazola atu a mbari ya Dani achisala ko myangoni, wala taayaruhusiwa kusagala seemu za kugbwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aamori aenderera kusagala mwango wa Heresi, na kpwenye midzi ya Aijaloni na Shaalibimu. Ela atu a mbari ya Yusufu ariphophaha nguvu aalazimisha Aamori ahende kazi za shokowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mphaka wa Aamori waandzira unaphoambuka kuphiya Akirabimu hadi Sela na kpwenderera uphande wa dzulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.36"
            ]
          }
        }
